  "body": "## Wallpaper Reactor 0.32.0\n\n_Changes since 0.31.0_\n\n## Features\n\n### All platforms\n\n- Collection names and descriptions are translated, just like wallpapers\n- The wallpaper's frame rate is limited only while the app covers the wallpaper's display\n\n### Android\n\n- A keyboard shortcuts helper lists the app's shortcuts\n- The caption bar is transparent on Android 15 and later\n- The pointer becomes an I-beam over text\n\n## Fixes\n\n### Android\n\n- Fixed the app restarting when display size, font size, layout direction or navigation mode changed\n- Fixed the app restarting when a wallpaper's Material You colors were applied\n\n## Downloads\n\n| Platform | Get it |\n| --- | --- |\n| Android | [Google Play](https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=app.wallpaperreactor) · [APK](https://github.com/wallpaper-reactor/wallpaper-reactor-website/releases/download/0.32.0/wallpaper-reactor-v0.32.0-android.apk) |\n| Windows | [Microsoft Store](https://apps.microsoft.com/detail/9N4302CRDQRL) · [Installer (.exe)](https://github.com/wallpaper-reactor/wallpaper-reactor-website/releases/download/0.32.0/wallpaper-reactor-v0.32.0-windows-x64-setup.exe) · [.msi](https://github.com/wallpaper-reactor/wallpaper-reactor-website/releases/download/0.32.0/wallpaper-reactor-v0.32.0-windows-x64.msi) |\n| macOS | [Mac App Store](https://apps.apple.com/us/app/wallpaper-reactor-lite/id6751447022) · [.dmg](https://github.com/wallpaper-reactor/wallpaper-reactor-website/releases/download/0.32.0/wallpaper-reactor-v0.32.0-macos-universal.dmg) |\n| Linux (KDE Plasma, GNOME, Sway, Hyprland) | [.deb](https://github.com/wallpaper-reactor/wallpaper-reactor-website/releases/download/0.32.0/wallpaper-reactor-v0.32.0-linux-amd64.deb) · [Flatpak](https://github.com/wallpaper-reactor/wallpaper-reactor-website/releases/download/0.32.0/wallpaper-reactor-v0.32.0-linux-amd64.flatpak) |\n"
